<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay May inflation up 0.3 pct - Central Bank.</title>
<headline>Paraguay May inflation up 0.3 pct - Central Bank.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan inflation rose 0.3 percent in May, up from 0.2 percent in April, the Central Bank said Friday.</p>
<p>Inflation in May 1996 was 0.4 percent.</p>
<p>Annual inflation was 7.4 percent in May, compared with 10.5 percent in May 1996. ((-- Daniela Desantis, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8))</p>
</text>
